(7420246, 1170697, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sharp and clear with good colors. I think the problem you had with this one is the lighting was very harsh and unappealing. I haven''t been very good with artificial lighting myself, and eventually realized that studio type stuff just wasn''t where my interest lied. You may find differently. Perhaps an inexpensive softbox would be a good investment?</td>', 'Sharp and clear with good colors. I think the problem you had with this one is the lighting was very harsh and unappealing. I haven''t been very good with artificial lighting myself, and eventually realized that studio type stuff just wasn''t where my interest lied. You may find differently. Perhaps an inexpensive softbox would be a good investment?', '2015-12-03 22:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
